{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/sarif-2.1/schema/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "tachi-risk-scorer",
          "version": "1.0",
          "semanticVersion": "1.0",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/owner/tachi",
          "supportedTaxonomies": [
            {
              "name": "OWASP",
              "index": 0
            },
            {
              "name": "CWE",
              "index": 1
            }
          ],
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "tachi/stride/spoofing",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Identity spoofing threats"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Threats where an attacker pretends to be something or someone else, such as replaying credentials or impersonating a trusted component."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review authentication mechanisms, token validation, credential storage and session management at every trust boundary.",
                "markdown": "## Detection Guidance\n\nReview authentication mechanisms for weaknesses:\n- Token signing and binding\n- Credential storage and rotation\n- Session management\n\n## Framework References\n\n- OWASP Top 10: A07 Identification and Authentication Failures\n- CWE-287: Improper Authentication"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride",
                  "spoofing",
                  "authentication"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.1"
              },
              "relationships": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "A07",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "OWASP"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "CWE-287",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "CWE"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tachi/stride/tampering",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Data tampering threats"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Threats where an attacker modifies data or code without authorization, in transit, at rest or in the build and deployment path."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review input validation, message integrity, configuration control and supply chain provenance.",
                "markdown": "## Detection Guidance\n\nReview integrity controls:\n- Schema validation at boundaries\n- Message signing\n- Build provenance\n\n## Framework References\n\n- OWASP Top 10: A08 Software and Data Integrity Failures\n- CWE-345: Insufficient Verification of Data Authenticity"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride",
                  "tampering",
                  "integrity"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              },
              "relationships": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "A08",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "OWASP"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "CWE-345",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "CWE"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tachi/stride/repudiation",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Repudiation threats"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Threats where an actor can deny an action because the system cannot prove who did what and when."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review audit logging, log protection, time synchronisation and approval binding.",
                "markdown": "## Detection Guidance\n\nReview accountability controls:\n- Who, what, when and outcome in every record\n- Tamper-evident storage\n- Approval binding\n\n## Framework References\n\n- OWASP Top 10: A09 Security Logging and Monitoring Failures\n- CWE-778: Insufficient Logging"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride",
                  "repudiation",
                  "logging"
                ],
                "security-severity": "6.2"
              },
              "relationships": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "A09",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "OWASP"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "CWE-778",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "CWE"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Information disclosure threats"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Threats where sensitive data is exposed to parties that should not see it, through errors, logs, storage or transport."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review error handling, logging content, encryption in transit and at rest, and tenant isolation.",
                "markdown": "## Detection Guidance\n\nReview confidentiality controls:\n- Error and log content\n- Encryption in transit and at rest\n- Tenant isolation\n\n## Framework References\n\n- OWASP Top 10: A01 Broken Access Control\n- CWE-200: Exposure of Sensitive Information"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride",
                  "information-disclosure",
                  "data-exposure"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.4"
              },
              "relationships": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "A01",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "OWASP"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "CWE-200",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "CWE"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tachi/stride/denial-of-service",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Denial of service threats"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Threats where an attacker degrades or prevents legitimate use through resource exhaustion or cascading dependency failure."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review limits on concurrency, payload size, retries and dependency timeouts.",
                "markdown": "## Detection Guidance\n\nReview availability controls:\n- Rate and concurrency limits\n- Timeouts and bulkheads\n- Capacity alerts\n\n## Framework References\n\n- OWASP Top 10: A05 Security Misconfiguration\n- CWE-400: Uncontrolled Resource Consumption"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride",
                  "denial-of-service",
                  "availability"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.9"
              },
              "relationships": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "A05",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "OWASP"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "CWE-400",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "CWE"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
                    "relevant"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tachi/stride/elevation-of-privilege",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Elevation of privilege threats"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Threats where a caller gains rights that were not granted, through missing ownership checks, role confusion or excess permissions."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review authorization at every object and action, role resolution and the permissions each service holds.",
                "markdown": "## Detection Guidance\n\nReview authorization controls:\n- Ownership checks on object references\n- Role resolution\n- Least privilege\n\n## Framework References\n\n- OWASP Top 10: A01 Broken Access Control\n- CWE-269: Improper Privilege Management"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride",
                  "elevation-of-privilege",
                  "authorization"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              },
              "relationships": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "id": "A01",
                    "toolComponent": {
                      "name": "OWASP"
                    }
                  },
                  "kinds": [
