          "message": {
            "text": "Retry storms from router-agent multiply the load on worker-3 when it slows down, turning a brief delay into a sustained outage.",
            "markdown": "Add jittered exponential backoff and a retry budget to router-agent, and enable a circuit breaker so that worker-3 can recover."
          },
